function cleanDescription(value){return txt(value).replace(/(MCG|MG|ML|UI|\bG)(?=(ENVASE|CAJA|PAQUETE|BOLSA|BOTELLA|TUBO|LATA|BLISTER|SOBRE))/gi,'$1. ').replace(/\s+/g,' ').trim();}
